    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"messagebox-main\">\n<div class=\"messagebox-image nomobile\" style=\"\">\n<p><span class=\"notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Tyashoi_Alchemist_Head.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Tyashoi_Alchemist_Head.png/64px-Tyashoi_Alchemist_Head.png?7e1dc\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Tyashoi_Alchemist_Head.png/128px-Tyashoi_Alchemist_Head.png?7e1dc 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox-text\" style=\"\">\n<p><b>Great Spook Exclusive</b><br />\n<b>Fairy Wings</b> is only available during <a href=\"/w/The_Great_Spook\" title=\"The Great Spook\">The Great Spook</a>, when the <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Tyashoi_Alchemist\" title=\"Tyashoi Alchemist\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Tyashoi Alchemist in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Tyashoi_Alchemist_Sprite.png/16px-Tyashoi_Alchemist_Sprite.png?a6f7a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Tyashoi_Alchemist_Sprite.png/32px-Tyashoi_Alchemist_Sprite.png?a6f7a 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"288\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Tyashoi_Alchemist\" title=\"Tyashoi Alchemist\">Tyashoi Alchemist</a> is present in the <a href=\"/w/Farm\" title=\"Farm\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#xe067; </span></span><span class=\"light-color color-yellow\" style=\"\">Farm</span></a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox-aside\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"infobox\"><div class=\"infobox-title\">Fairy Wings</div><div class=\"infobox-panel\"><ul class=\"infobox-section-labels\"><li class=\"label-active\" style=\"display:none\"></li></ul><div class=\"section active\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><span class=\"mw-default-size pi-image-thumbnail\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Fairy_Wings.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Fairy Wings.png\"><img alt=\"Fairy Wings.png\" src=\"/images/Fairy_Wings.png?1d049\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"mcui-row\"><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"epic\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;5Fairy Wings\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;7No fairies were harmed in the/&amp;7obtaining of this item.//&amp;8&amp;l* &amp;8Co-op Soulbound &amp;l*/&amp;5&amp;lEPIC\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Fairy Wings\"><img alt=\"Fairy Wings.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Fairy_Wings.png/32px-Fairy_Wings.png?1d049\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Fairy_Wings.png/64px-Fairy_Wings.png?1d049 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Type</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\nItem</div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Rarity</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-sort-value=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Epic\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-dark&#95;purple\" style=\"\">EPIC</span></span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"group layout-horizontal\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Item Properties</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><abbr title=\"Whether or not the item(s) can be sold to an NPC. If an item is not salable but has enchantments on it, it becomes salable.\" tabindex=\"0\">Salable</abbr></div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Tradeable</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Auctionable</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><abbr title=\"Whether or not the item(s) can be donated to the Museum\" tabindex=\"0\">Museum</abbr></div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Soulbound</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-a\">✔</span></span> <span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\"><b>Yes</b></span> (Solo)</div></div></div><div class=\"group\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(1, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Item Metadata</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Item ID</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<code>FAIRY_WINGS</code></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Fairy Wings</b> is an <span data-sort-value=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Epic\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-dark&#95;purple\" style=\"\">EPIC</span></span></a></span> item.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtaining\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtaining</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Usage\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Usage</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Fairy_Wings?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Obtaining\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Fairy_Wings?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Obtaining\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p><b>Fairy Wings</b> is obtained by hitting <a href=\"/w/Fairy\" title=\"Fairy\">Fairies</a> in <a href=\"/w/The_Catacombs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Catacombs\">The Catacombs</a> with <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Enchanted_Shears\" title=\"Enchanted Shears\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Shears.png/21px-Enchanted_Shears.png?1095b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Shears.png/42px-Enchanted_Shears.png?1095b 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Enchanted_Shears\" title=\"Enchanted Shears\">Enchanted Shears</a> whilst the <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Tyashoi_Alchemist\" title=\"Tyashoi Alchemist\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Tyashoi Alchemist in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Tyashoi_Alchemist_Sprite.png/16px-Tyashoi_Alchemist_Sprite.png?a6f7a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Tyashoi_Alchemist_Sprite.png/32px-Tyashoi_Alchemist_Sprite.png?a6f7a 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"288\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Tyashoi_Alchemist\" title=\"Tyashoi Alchemist\">Tyashoi Alchemist</a> is in the <a href=\"/w/Village\" title=\"Village\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#xe067; </span></span><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\" style=\"\">Village</span></a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Fairy_Wings?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Usage\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Fairy_Wings?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Usage\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p><span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Great_Spook_Talisman\" title=\"Great Spook Talisman\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Great_Spook_Talisman.png/21px-Great_Spook_Talisman.png?1a4a7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Great_Spook_Talisman.png/42px-Great_Spook_Talisman.png?1a4a7 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">1</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Great_Spook_Talisman\" title=\"Great Spook Talisman\">Great Spook Talisman</a> can be bought from the <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Tyashoi_Alchemist\" title=\"Tyashoi Alchemist\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Tyashoi Alchemist in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Tyashoi_Alchemist_Sprite.png/16px-Tyashoi_Alchemist_Sprite.png?a6f7a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Tyashoi_Alchemist_Sprite.png/32px-Tyashoi_Alchemist_Sprite.png?a6f7a 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"288\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Tyashoi_Alchemist\" title=\"Tyashoi Alchemist\">Tyashoi Alchemist</a> for <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Fairy_Wings\" title=\"Fairy Wings\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Fairy_Wings.png/21px-Fairy_Wings.png?1d049\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Fairy_Wings.png/42px-Fairy_Wings.png?1d049 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">5</span>&#160;<a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Fairy Wings</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Fairy_Wings?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Fairy_Wings?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Trivia\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>Using regular <a href=\"/w/Shears\" title=\"Shears\">shears</a> with enchantments will prompt the following response: <div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-d\">&lt;name&gt; the Fairy</span><span class=\"format-f\">: I like your spirit, but those are not mysterious enough!</span></div></div></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"History\">History</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Fairy_Wings?section=4&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Fairy_Wings?action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: History\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable pixelated\" data-description=\"History\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Prototype\" title=\"SkyBlock Prototype\">SkyBlock Prototype</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\">Oct&#160;5,&#160;2022</th><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Fairy_Wings.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Fairy_Wings.png/26px-Fairy_Wings.png?1d049\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Fairy_Wings.png/52px-Fairy_Wings.png?1d049 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span> Added <b>Fairy Wings</b>.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Navigation\">Navigation</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Fairy_Wings?section=5&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Navigation\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Fairy_Wings?action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Navigation\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<pre class=\"machine-metadata noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">&#91;&#34;Great Spook Gloves&#34;,&#34;Great Spook Necklace&#34;,&#34;Great Spook Cloak&#34;,&#34;Great Spook Belt&#34;,&#34;Great Spook Armor&#34;&#93;</pre><pre class=\"machine-metadata noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">&#91;&#34;Great Spook Sword&#34;,&#34;Great Spook Staff&#34;&#93;</pre><pre class=\"machine-metadata noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">&#91;&#34;Great Spook Artifact&#34;,&#34;Great Spook Ring&#34;,&#34;Great Spook Talisman&#34;&#93;</pre><pre class=\"machine-metadata noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">&#91;&#34;Eerie Toy&#34;,&#34;Eerie Treat&#34;,&#34;Eerie Pet&#34;&#93;</pre><pre class=\"machine-metadata noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">&#91;&#34;Great Spook (Enchantment)&#34;,&#34;Scary Grimoire&#34;,&#34;Great Spook Potion&#34;,&#34;Alchemist Recipe&#34;,&#34;Boo Stone&#34;,&#34;Great Spook Reforging Manual&#34;&#93;</pre><pre class=\"machine-metadata noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">&#91;&#34;Rogue Flesh&#34;,&#34;Sweet Flesh&#34;,&#34;Poisoned Candy&#34;,&#34;Decayed Bat&#34;,&#34;Wet Pumpkin&#34;,&#34;Frozen Spider&#34;&#93;</pre><pre class=\"machine-metadata noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">&#91;&#34;Free Spider&#34;,&#34;Fairy Wings&#34;,&#34;Dead Seed&#34;,&#34;Head of Betrayal&#34;,&#34;Obscure Ending&#34;,&#34;Precious&#34;&#93;</pre><pre class=\"machine-metadata noexcerpt navigation-not-searchabl